stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AUTHORIZED: POST /orders 201<br/>(reserve + authorize both sync,<br/>order persisted only on success)

    note left of AUTHORIZED
        Failed checkouts return 400/402/409/503,
        create no order and send no email —
        the customer sees the reason in-session.
        ("item out of stock" / "payment failed"
        checkout emails removed)
    end note

    AUTHORIZED --> DISPATCHING: PaymentAuthorized event
    DISPATCHING --> DISPATCHED: DispatchConfirmed<br/>("your order shipped" email)
    DISPATCHING --> DISPATCH_FAILED: DispatchFailed
    DISPATCHING --> AUTH_EXPIRED: PaymentAuthorizationExpired<br/>(background sweep)

    DISPATCHED --> CONFIRMED: PaymentCaptured
    DISPATCHED --> PAYMENT_FAILED: PaymentFailed<br/>(capture_failed, manual reconciliation)

    AUTH_EXPIRED --> CANCELLED: release stock, notify
    DISPATCH_FAILED --> CANCELLED: void authorization,<br/>release stock, notify

    PAYMENT_FAILED --> [*]: "payment problem on dispatch" email
    CONFIRMED --> [*]: receipt email
    CANCELLED --> [*]: cancellation email
